Subject: [PATCH 04/11] Describe the fork for the agents working in it

AGENTS.md says what the fork is (branch charon from tag v3.1.1, the
release the machine runs), where the addon code and its tests live,
how to build into our own prefix through heavy.sh, how to run the tests
with their own XMAKE_GLOBALDIR and how to run the control without our
fixes. .claude/settings.json is the one the other repositories of the
workspace carry; upstream's .gitignore ignores .claude, so it is added
explicitly.

